= Bidirectional navigation <features-bidirectional-navigation>
#set heading(outlined: false)

#import "../template.typ": screenshot
#screenshot("bidirectional-navigation")

The editors and the preview *show the same highlighted text*, in both directions:

- click a text in the preview pane on the right and the corresponding text in the editor is shown.
- highlight text in the editor; this is highlighted in the preview.

By default, preview scrolling follows the text.
